H4813G.def:
A woman of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 15:20; 
daughter of: Amram (H6019) and Jochebed (H3115); 
sister of: Moses (H4872) and Aaron (H0175)
§ Miriam = "rebellion"
1) elder sister of Moses and Aaron
2) a woman of Judah

H4813H.def:
A woman of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:17; 
daughter of: Mered (H4778)(?) and Bithiah (H1332); 
sister of: Shammai (H8060I) and Ishbah (H3431); 
half-sister of: Jered (H3382H)(?), Heber (H2268I)(?) and Jekuthiel (H3354)(?)
§ Miriam = "rebellion"
1) elder sister of Moses and Aaron
2) a woman of Judah

H4821.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:10; 
son of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hodesh (H2321); 
brother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634), Abitub (H0036) and Elpaal (H0508) 
§ Mirma = "fraud"
a Benjamite born in the land of Moab

H4847.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:11; 
son of: Levi (H3878); 
brother of: Gershon (H1648), Kohath (H6955) and Jochebed (H3115); 
father of: Mahli (H4249), Mushi (H4187) and Jaaziah (H3269)
Also named: me.ra.ri (מְרָרִי "Merari" H4848) 
§ Merari = "bitter"
the 3rd son of Levi and head of a Levitical family

H4848.def:
Someone descended from Merari who was a man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:11; 
son of: Levi (H3878); 
brother of: Gershon (H1648), Kohath (H6955) and Jochebed (H3115); 
father of: Mahli (H4249), Mushi (H4187) and Jaaziah (H3269)
Another name of me.ra.ri (מְרָרִי "Merari" H4847) 
§ Merarites, of Marari "bitter"
descendants of Merari, the son of Levi, and members of a Levitical family

H4851.def:
A man of the Syrians living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:23; 
son of: Aram (H0758); 
brother of: Uz (H5780), Hul (H2343) and Gether (H1666); also called Meshech at 1 Chroniques 1:17; 
Also named: me.shekh (מֶ֫שֶׁךְ "Meshech" H4902J) 
§ Mash = "drawn out"
one of the sons of Aram; also 'Meshech'

H4854.def:
A man of the Arabs living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 25:14; 
son of: Ishmael (H3458); 
brother of: Nebaioth (H5032), Kedar (H6938), Adbeel (H0110), Mibsam (H4017), Mishma (H4927), Dumah (H1746), Hadad (H2301), Tema (H8485), Jetur (H3195), Naphish (H5305), Kedemah (H6929) and Mahalath (H4258) 
§ Massa = "burden"
a son of Ishmael

H4872.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 2:10; 
son of: Amram (H6019) and Jochebed (H3115); 
brother of: Aaron (H0175) and Miriam (H4813); married to Zipporah (H6855); 
father of: Gershom (H1647) and Eliezer (H0461H); also called Manasseh at Juges 18:30(?) 
§ Moses = "drawn"
the prophet and lawgiver, leader of the exodus

